 restaurant food bill, plus a separate 18% GST applied to the delivery fee.", "reference_indexes": [0]}, {"snippet": "Outdoor Catering Services (Standalone): 5% GST without ITC, or 18% GST with ITC for hotel-based or premium outdoor catering.", "reference_indexes": [3, 4]}, {"snippet": "Alcohol-serving Restaurants: 18% GST (Note: alcohol itself is subject to state excise laws and outside the GST framework)."}], "reference_indexes": [5]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "If you're calculating a specific bill, let me know:"}, {"type": "list", "list": [{"snippet": "Is it a standalone restaurant or inside a hotel?"}, {"snippet": "Are you looking at a dine-in, takeaway, or delivery order?"}]}], "references": [{"index": 0, "title": "GST on Restaurants & Food Services in India (2026) - DMI Finance", "link": "https://www.dmifinance.in/gst/gst-on-restaurants-food-services/", "snippet": "GST on Restaurants & Food Services in India (2026) ... A growing number of people prefer to eat out. This is why there is a huge demand for restaurants, cloud kitc...", "source": "DMI Finance", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.dmifinance.in&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSMTMVb7hL14b0P4ft75_ZQO0B9MMvtlf9im5n7h9LVtVvBEPtR0iGtype80OjvSLBmU5gSl7L2HRwJXQpqVLrXlIsi"}, {"index": 1, "title": "Know GST Rates for Restaurants - Composition Scheme", "link": "https://busy.in/gst/taxability-of-restaurants-under-gst-composition-scheme/", "snippet": "Frequently Asked Questions * How does the government apply GST on different types of restaurant services? The GST on restaurant services is 5% for all food and dri...", "source": "BUSY", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://busy.in&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTddMGhR7Guc3gW6urnKmL5H